    <!-- Help & FAQ Bottom Sheet -->
    <string name="help_faq_title">Help &amp; FAQ</string>
    <string name="help_faq_subtitle">Guides, tips &amp; app info</string>
    <string name="help_faq_section_faq">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</string>
    <string name="help_faq_section_app_info">APP INFORMATION</string>
    <string name="help_faq_q_filter">How do I filter train lines or directions?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_a_filter">Tap on any colored line pill badge at the top of a station card. Tapping once filters by that line. Tapping again cycles through available directions (e.g., Eastbound / Westbound). Tapping once more clears the filter.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_q_tracking">How does Live Train Tracking work?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_a_tracking">Tap \'Track\' on any departure row or journey view to launch a persistent Live Update notification with dynamic countdowns. When the train arrives or countdown reaches 0, tracking automatically completes.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_q_widgets">How do I add home screen widgets?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_a_widgets">Touch and hold an empty space on your home screen, tap \'Widgets\', find EkiBoard, and drag it to your screen. You can configure each widget to show all lines or focus on a specific line or bus route.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_q_reorder">How do I reorder or remove station cards?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_a_reorder">To reorder: Long-press any station card on the dashboard and drag it to your desired position.\nTo delete: Swipe the station card left to remove it. An \'Undo\' snackbar appears at the bottom if removed by mistake.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_q_ai">What is Transit AI Assistant?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_a_ai">Tap the floating sparkle button on the bottom right to ask questions like \'Next train from Kings Cross to Waterloo\' or \'Is the Central line delayed?\'. It uses on-device Gemini Nano with cloud fallback.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_q_data">Where does the live transit data come from?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_a_data">All real-time arrival predictions, platform information, and service disruption alerts are powered directly by official transport open data (Transport for London TfL, UK BODS, National Rail, Hong Kong DATA.GOV.HK / MTR / KMB / Citybus, Singapore LTA DataMall, Transport for NSW, and Tokyo Metro Open Data).</string>
    <string name="help_faq_app_description">Open-source transit companion built with Jetpack Compose &amp; Material 3 Expressive. Powered by Official Open Data.</string>

